\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Per-prompt scores over nine thousand held-out Bernoulli outcomes. The plug-in's log loss is dominated by zero-training- success prompts that succeed in the held-out half; the posterior predictive prices those prompts at their shrunken posterior rate instead of zero. The two prior families tie.}}{4}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
